   "text": "Lynn University - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nLynn University\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nLynn University is an independent college based in Boca Raton, Florida, with approximately 3,500 students from over 100 countries. U.S. News & World Report has recognized Lynn for its innovation, international students and value. Lynn's NCAA Division II Fighting Knights have won 27 national titles, its Conservatory of Music features a world-renowned faculty of performers, and its nationally recognized Institute for Achievement and Learning empowers students with learning differences. \nThe school's Dialogues curriculum and award-winning use of mobile technology help Lynn graduates gain the intellectual flexibility and global experience to fulfill their potential in an ever-changing world.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n21/04/2026 05:45\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n21/04/2026 05:45\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$44,700.00\nMin: US$27,200.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n16%\n560 of 3,500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nShorelight Education\nFounded Year\n1962\nCampus(es)\nBoca Raton\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n09/07/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.lynn.edu/admission/tuition-aid/undergraduate#scholarships-aid\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@lynnuniversity\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
